{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act15side_level_act15side_01_beg",
  "groupId": "act15side",
  "stageId": "act15side_01",
  "title": "化物",
  "storyCode": "IW-1",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6f0af3707a5107bddc66ece62a695b8a925790c53db0f346e575a04ec0438e8c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "1上"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "客棧在尚蜀有十數個分號。不過，分號並不叫行裕，也許叫行祿，也許叫行福，而叫行裕的，只此一家。\n當然也只此一家，既能見近處高樓夜景，亦能眺遠方雙月映湖。掌櫃的選址，從來只看風景。至於什麼客流，租價，那是從來不在意的。\n風景好了，客人心情就好。風景好了，便是與天地同心，想不賺錢都難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "嗯......確實是好茶，好景。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "初來乍到，挑個好地方落腳。對尚蜀有個好印象。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "行裕客棧，很古雅的名字。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "是家名店，但最早不是做餐飲這行的，不過這些年突然轉了行，掌櫃的有本事，做起生意來也是順風順水。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "即便家大業大，老掌櫃的也......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......是那位忙忙碌碌的老先生？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "可不是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "半點看不出老闆模樣，兢兢業業，令人心生敬佩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "就是不知道我那位姓梁的昔日同窗......如今在做什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "你自己說了嘛，兢兢業業。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......是個好官？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "街上隨便拉個路人，擦鞋的，賣山芋的，或者計程車司機，誰提到梁大人都豎大拇指。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......哈哈，那也算是他得償所願了，羡慕不來啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "我聽梁大人提起，你與他，已有十多年沒見了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "可梁大人依然選你，來送這件貨物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "沒錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "那你倆的關係，也要豎大拇指了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "我沒見識，看不出這東西的好壞，只是看梁大人那神色就知道，此事大意不得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "哪裡哪裡，我可不敢與“梁大人”高攀什麼關係，不過要說梁洵此人，倒確實算個朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "朋友？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "好朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "好朋友難得。十幾年沒見過了，還能當好朋友的，更難得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "那你呢，慎師傅？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "碼頭渡口有那麼多擺渡師傅，我偏偏上了你的船，你就不奇怪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "不奇怪。梁大人交代過我，那多半也交代過你。具體的，我沒必要問。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "這是替梁大人從走私販手裡搶來的，費了不少功夫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "......我沒問，你倒也說了，憋得慌吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "千里迢迢，實在缺個說話的伴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "你倒是信得過那姓梁的，明明他長了副生人勿近的冷淡嘴臉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "哎。你信他，是因為他是你朋友，我信他，是因為他是尚蜀的父母官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "兩位認識？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "認識，梁大人對我們好，就認識。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "慎師傅做這行多少年了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "記不清啦......誰掰著手指頭數自己漂泊了多少年呢？約莫有個......二三十年？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "慎師傅也值得敬佩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "船夫而已，有啥好敬佩的。這幾年船都裝上發動機了，再過幾年，我怕我都要失業。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "那也得靠人引航尋路，看一路天況如何。想來走水路的船夫，但凡水路長些，歲月久些，也都和天災信使相去無幾了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "......天災啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "不常遇到，但要是遇到了，終生難忘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "慎師傅遇見過天災？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "遇見過，但也見過比天災更嚇人的，不過不是在江上——得了，說這些做什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "......唔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "怎麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "......稀奇，好像是外國人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "欸，客人兩位？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "兩位。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "這就是你說的“名聲在外，菜品一絕，服務周到，童叟無欺”的行裕客棧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "當然當然，我師父過去就曾誇獎過“行裕”，一直沒機會來尚蜀，這不就特地帶恩人找來了嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "唉，只是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "只是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "嘿嘿，說來慚愧，師父只是誇了，沒說誇什麼。所以我也不知道這行裕客棧厲害在哪兒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "來，茶水。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "二位，打尖還是住店？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "哇哦，標準的客棧開場詞欸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "嘿，您別說，咱們雖然開張沒幾年，可真要論“行裕”這個名字，也算個百年老字號啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "恩人，反正是要找個落腳處的。這裡價格也合適，離約定的北渡口也不遠，不如？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "我是隨便啦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "客房兩間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "好的。要吃點東西嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "都有什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "推薦套餐就打在牌子上。現在按午市算，您有什麼需要，招呼一聲就行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "好，我瞧瞧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "這個看起來不錯欸，很有大炎風情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "......恩人，這個特辣毛血旺套餐......我們還是別點了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "為什麼？入鄉隨俗，幹嘛不嘗試一下？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "根據我的經驗，這種菜品，不適合您這樣的雷姆必拓人在中午大快朵頤。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "是這樣嗎？我還挺能吃辣的喔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "......你在看什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "看那邊那位掌櫃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "厲害。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "怎麼厲害？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "有這麼大一份家業，當然厲害。不過更厲害的是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "......手上有繭？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "恩人果然好眼力！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "而且從進門起，二樓就有兩位客人在打量我們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "怎麼一直盯著他們？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "咦......怎麼那位卡特斯看著這麼面熟......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "掌櫃的，您今天就待咱們這兒？不去渡口那邊看看？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "不去，今天和人有約了，就在這兒待客。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "嘿，掌櫃的還特地親自接待，那想必是個大客戶了，咱們今天也能開張了？能賺多少？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "錢未必賺得，事兒倒是少不了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "......是那邊的生意？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "是也不是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "此話怎講？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "別這麼囉嗦，還不快去迎客。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "嘁，小氣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "欸歡迎光臨，幾位客官，不知——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "......哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "杜小姐？您這是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "和你沒關係，一邊去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "喂！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "哇——姑娘好大的嗓門，找我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "......一身花裡胡哨的穿著，戴眼鏡，看著像神棍的邋遢小哥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "那就是你了，對吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "......呃......這評價是不是有點......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "是你的仇家？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "不，再怎麼說他們也不至於喊個小丫頭來......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "說誰小丫頭呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "（一腳挑飛了木椅——好腿法！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "哼。坐著就能躲開，反應倒挺快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "text": "大小姐，大小姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "幹嘛，沒看我忙著——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "text": "這男人是個黎博利吧，我記得信上說，那人是龍來著......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "......那就是樓上那個人了，是你了，對吧！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "喂，起碼道個歉吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "好了好了......嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......我自覺衣品不錯來著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "看這架勢，來者不善哪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "進門欺負一下木椅，可憐那位小哥險些白挨了一頓打。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "既然已經被本小姐找到，就老老實實把東西交出來吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "哼，敢在光天化日之下混進城，你也算膽子大的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......這位杜小姐，怕是有什麼誤會吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "你是不是從龍門來？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "呃，是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "是不是帶著一隻古董酒盞？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "那本小姐給你一分鐘時間狡辯。時間到了，就乖乖把東西交了，跟我走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "這年頭小姑娘都這樣不聽人話嗎......真讓人懷念我家那幾個懂事的孩子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "......不用這麼看我。梁大人也交代過，這酒盞是他專程托你從龍門帶來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "既然梁大人說了，那我就信任他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "那是，多謝慎師傅信任。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "稀奇了......既然是梁大人所托，這小丫頭竟然還敢光明正大說要搶？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "這隻酒盞，是我家某位大姑娘從一夥走私販子手裡搶來的，要真說有沒有合法手續......哈哈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "酒盞很奇特？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "調查過一番，只留下些不明所以的傳說，是那些走私販從當地人口中聽來的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "唉，怎麼就撞上這麼麻煩的事情了呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "（小烏有，這一幕我在電影裡見過哎！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "（我也見過！不過一般這種時候就要喊警察啦，總不至於真打起來......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "喂，別嘀嘀咕咕了，想好藉口了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "（這小姑娘，扯起嗓門中氣十足啊......二樓那兩位，就是嫌疑人了？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "（恩人？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "（小烏有......那個人......我好像認識......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "（什麼？那位確實與我有七分形似兩分神似的人？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "（不是，他......呃......算羅德島的合作人......還有一分呢？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "這樣吧，這位小姐，反正我已經被你抓到了，逃不掉，不如把警察喊來......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "想拖延時間是吧，好啊，本小姐倒要看看你能拖延多久。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "給我上！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "text": "別讓他跑了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "且慢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "......怎麼，想給剛才的事討個公道？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "你讓本小姐辦完事，你這兩天在這裡的開銷，本小姐就包了，如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "恩人，您先仔細瞧瞧，要是認錯了人，我們攬上這事可就虧大了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "......鯉先生？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "你......金頭髮，看不出睜眼還是閉眼的小兔子......你是羅德島的幹員？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "天下之大，大炎之大，尚蜀之大，恩人恰好能在一家小酒館裡他鄉遇故知，是多低的機率......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "還請各位，給個薄面，莫要掃興。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "——什麼亂七八糟的，你們果然是一夥的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "圍住他們！今天不把贓物交出來，誰也別想走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哦？為何突然有此想法？\n夢見罔兩問景，有感而發。\n那我倒是想瞧瞧，這些尋常物件，你打算如何讓它們顯靈？\n就當是我無心之舉吧，別笑話我就是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "什麼......剛才......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "恩人，小心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "都是些普通人，下手輕點哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "text": "那個黎博利是個練家子的！小心點！這個卡特斯就交給我——欸？人呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "怎麼二話不說就動起手來了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "text": "什、什麼時候跑到二樓去了！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "沒必要傷人，小烏有，悠著點哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "鯉先生，這邊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "唉，把你們捲進來了，真是抱歉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "能在這裡遇見鯉先生，也算是意料之外吧。好了，還是先離開這裡吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "喂——！你們當我不存在嗎！？想走就走的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "抱歉，此路不通。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "你說了算嗎！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "......扇子？那神棍......啊不是，那位客人竟然使的是如此少見的功夫？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "鄭掌櫃？掌櫃的？您再不勸勸架，一樓桌椅要被拆光啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "......唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "我看那使扇的小哥招招有驚無險，遊刃有餘。不過大小姐倒也沒有傾盡全力，趕緊勸勸，還能和氣生財。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "她好歹還顧慮著點......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "唉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "貴人哪！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "早春，傍晚，風如期而至，雨未必來。尚蜀的春天，一向如此。\n男人抬頭望天，雲霧繚繞，晦明不定，但極遠處，卻又隱隱得見天光。\n春寒料峭，輕風拂衣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不苟言笑的男子",
      "text": "算算時間，他也該到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不苟言笑的男子",
      "text": "......嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不苟言笑的男子",
      "text": "但願事情能順利結束。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
